                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Investing in our children is crucial for creating a better tomorrow for Georgia families. Recently, I met with Great Kids, Inc., which is headquartered in Columbus, GA, to talk about early childhood development, home visiting, and health care programs that help give our kids the foundation they need to succeed.",
