                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "March is #NationalKidneyMonth! Kidney disease is often called a \"silent disease\" because there are few symptoms in early stages, making testing essential for early diagnosis. In Congress, I\u2019m working to break down barriers to medical care for kidney patients and focus on disease prevention and early detection.",
