                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Fentanyl continues to hurt communities across America and tear apart families. the HALT Fentanyl Act helps in our fight against this public health emergency and threat to our national security. It empowers law enforcement to effectively prosecute the manufacturers and traffickers of new illicit drugs that are designed to look and act like fentanyl and are often more dangerous. It represents commonsense policy and has bipartisan support. That is why I, alongside the Congressional Blue Dog Coalition, urged Republican leaders to bring this bill to a vote and I was happy to support its passage.\n\nhttps://t.co/jDNBtYSV7G",
