                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When natural disaster strikes, there are many challenges people face \u2013 including access to medical care/treatment. Planning ahead can help. Here are some resources provided by Medicare.\n\nhttps://t.co/rxqgPQdYoX https://t.co/Zb20vyYIN7",
