                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This afternoon, I met with educational professionals from Houston County to discuss the impact of funding cuts to special education programs, ongoing teacher shortages, and mental health services in school districts in Georgia. Public education is the cornerstone of ensuring that every American child has an opportunity to learn, succeed, and make our country the strongest it can be. Congress must be a part of this effort and provide resources to support all students as well as the schools, teachers, and support staff that serve them.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
